#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:43
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:45
msgid ""
"Q-Diffusion for protein sequences combines a DPLM proposal model with a BM "
"energy reranker:"
msgstr "用于蛋白质序列的 Q-Diffusion 将 DPLM 提议模型与 BM 能量重排序器相结合："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:55
msgid "The key components:"
msgstr "关键组件："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:57
msgid ""
"**DPLM proposal model**: pre-trained protein language model produces logits "
"for each position."
msgstr "**DPLM 提议模型**：预训练的蛋白质语言模型为每个位置生成 logits。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:58
msgid ""
"**BM energy reranker**: scores candidate sequences using a Boltzmann Machine"
" energy function."
msgstr "**BM 能量重排序器**：使用玻尔兹曼机能量函数对候选序列打分。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:59
msgid ""
"**Energy-guided generation**: candidates are weighted by energy, improving "
"sequence quality."
msgstr "**能量引导生成**：候选序列按能量加权，从而提升序列质量。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:60
msgid ""
"**ESM2 evaluation**: generated sequences are compared to the reference "
"proteome using ESM2 embedding distances."
msgstr "**ESM2 评估**：使用 ESM2 嵌入距离将生成序列与参考蛋白质组进行比较。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:62
msgid ""
"The training objective optimizes the energy reranker, while the DPLM "
"proposal model remains frozen."
msgstr "训练目标优化能量重排序器，而 DPLM 提议模型保持冻结（frozen）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:64
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:66
msgid ""
"The steps below condense "
"`example/qdiffusion/simple/simple_train_example.py`, the minimal teaching "
"example, with imports omitted; run the script for the complete walkthrough."
msgstr ""
"以下步骤浓缩自 `example/qdiffusion/simple/simple_train_example.py`（最小教学示例），省略了 "
"import；运行该脚本可获得完整演练。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:68
msgid ""
"**1. Build the generator.** `build_qdiffusion` assembles the frozen DPLM "
"proposal model and the trainable BM energy reranker; both checkpoint "
"arguments are Hugging Face model IDs."
msgstr ""
"**1. 构建生成器。** `build_qdiffusion` 将冻结的 DPLM 提议模型与可训练的 BM 能量重排序器组装在一起；两个 "
"checkpoint 参数均为 Hugging Face 模型 ID。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:79
msgid ""
"**2. Tokenize one mini-batch.** Encode a few FASTA sequences with the "
"generator's own tokenizer; `targets` is the only tensor the outer loop needs"
" — `objective` creates the noisy states, samples candidates, and builds the "
"energy loss."
msgstr ""
"**2. 编码一个小批次。** 使用生成器自带的 tokenizer 编码几条 FASTA 序列；`targets` "
"是外层循环唯一需要的张量——`objective` 会创建噪声状态、采样候选并构建能量损失。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:87
msgid ""
"**3. Optimize the energy objective.** Only the energy-reranker parameters "
"are trainable; `objective` returns `energy_objective` (plus `logits` and "
"`loss_mask` for monitoring)."
msgstr ""
"**3. 优化能量目标。** 只有能量重排序器的参数可训练；`objective` 返回 `energy_objective`（以及用于监控的 "
"`logits` 与 `loss_mask`）。"

