msgid "1. Q-Diffusion Model Assembly"
msgstr "1\\. Q-Diffusion 模型组装"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:103
msgid ""
"The `dplm_builder.py` assembles a Q-Diffusion model from a DPLM proposal "
"model and a BM energy reranker:"
msgstr "`dplm_builder.py` 由一个 DPLM 提议模型和一个 BM 能量重排序器组装出 Q-Diffusion 模型："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:110
msgid "Key assembly details:"
msgstr "关键组装细节："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:111
msgid "Proposal model: DPLM protein language model (frozen)"
msgstr "提议模型：DPLM 蛋白质语言模型（冻结）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:112
msgid "Energy backend: Boltzmann Machine (trainable)"
msgstr "能量后端：玻尔兹曼机（可训练）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:113
msgid "Output: generic `Q-Diffusion` interface"
msgstr "输出：通用的 `Q-Diffusion` 接口"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:117
msgid "2. Training Objective"
msgstr "2\\. 训练目标"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:119
msgid ""
"The Q-Diffusion objective combines proposal logits with energy reranking:"
msgstr "Q-Diffusion 目标函数将提议 logits 与能量重排序相结合："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:125
msgid "Key training details:"
msgstr "关键训练细节："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:126
msgid "Proposal model: frozen, produces logits"
msgstr "提议模型：冻结，生成 logits"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:127
msgid "Energy reranker: trainable, scores candidates"
msgstr "能量重排序器：可训练，为候选序列打分"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:128
msgid "Loss: energy objective mean, backpropagated through the reranker"
msgstr "损失：能量目标的均值，通过重排序器反向传播"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:132
msgid "3. Generation and Evaluation"
msgstr "3\\. 生成与评估"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:134
msgid ""
"The generation loop samples from the proposal model and reranks with energy:"
msgstr "生成循环从提议模型中采样，并按能量重新排序："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:140
msgid "Training and Evaluation"
msgstr "训练 和 评估"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:142
msgid "**Training curves**: energy objective loss over epochs."
msgstr "**训练曲线**：各 epoch 的能量目标损失。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:143
msgid ""
"**Generated samples**: protein sequences generated by the guided workflow."
msgstr "**生成样本**：由引导工作流生成的蛋白质序列。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:144
msgid ""
"**ESM2 distance**: cosine and L2 distances between generated and reference "
"proteome embeddings."
msgstr "**ESM2 距离**：生成序列与参考蛋白质组嵌入之间的余弦距离和 L2 距离。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:145
msgid ""
"**Baseline vs guided**: compare baseline (DPLM only) vs guided (DPLM + BM "
"reranker) quality."
msgstr "**基线 vs 引导**：比较基线（仅 DPLM）与引导（DPLM + BM 重排序器）的质量。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:147
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "总结"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:149
msgid ""
"Q-Diffusion combines DPLM proposal models with BM energy reranking for "
"protein generation."
msgstr "Q-Diffusion 将 DPLM 提议模型与 BM 能量重排序相结合，用于蛋白质生成。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:150
msgid ""
"The energy reranker is trained on top of a frozen protein language model."
msgstr "能量重排序器在冻结的蛋白质语言模型之上训练。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:151
msgid ""
"Guided generation improves sequence quality measured by ESM2 embedding "
"distances."
msgstr "引导生成提升了以 ESM2 嵌入距离衡量的序列质量。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:152
msgid ""
"The Q-Diffusion pipeline combines a frozen DPLM proposal model with a "
"trainable BM energy reranker, and the same assembly pattern transfers to "
"other proposal models."
msgstr "Q-Diffusion 流水线将冻结的 DPLM 提议模型与可训练的 BM 能量重排序器相结合，且相同的组装模式可迁移到其他提议模型。"

